{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20228","headline":"峡哀 四 · 孟郊","name":"峡哀 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"峡乱鸣清磬，产石爲鲜鳞。\n喷爲腥雨涎，吹作黑井身。\n怪光闪衆异，饿劒唯待人。\n老肠未曾饱，古齿崭岩嗔。\n嚼齿三峡泉，三峡声齗齗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}